<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <!-- NuGet packaging metadata -->
    <PackageReleaseNotes>2.0.0 (WO-052 / P-328, P-331, P-332):
BREAKING CHANGE — Envelope/Envelope&lt;T&gt; moved from namespace SharedKernel.Contracts.Envelope (singular) to SharedKernel.Contracts.Envelopes (plural). This eliminates the long-standing namespace/type-name collision that previously required a `using EnvelopeNs = SharedKernel.Contracts.Envelope;` alias workaround at every consuming call site. Type members, factory methods, and implicit operators are byte-identical — this is a namespace-only move. Consumers must update their `using` statements from `SharedKernel.Contracts.Envelope` to `SharedKernel.Contracts.Envelopes` and remove any alias workaround; no other source change is required.
EventEnvelope&lt;TEvent&gt; gains an optional nullable `Guid? TenantId` property (positioned after CausationId) plus a trailing optional `Guid? tenantId = null` parameter on `EventEnvelope.Wrap` — purely additive, source- and binary-compatible with every existing call site. Populated only when the publisher explicitly supplies it; never inferred from Payload.
CursorPagedList&lt;T&gt; added — a new sealed record DTO in Pagination/ (namespace SharedKernel.Contracts.Pagination), the cursor/keyset-pagination counterpart to PagedList&lt;T&gt;. Carries Items/NextCursor/HasMore; deliberately no TotalCount/Page/PageSize. Create-only construction, purely additive.
This is the package's first breaking release since 1.0.0 — the major version bump reflects the namespace rename alone; the TenantId and CursorPagedList&lt;T&gt; additions are individually additive and ship in the same release.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Description>Cross-service DTOs for Platform.SharedKernel microservices: PagedList, CursorPagedList, Envelope, IIntegrationEvent, EventEnvelope transport wrapper (with optional TenantId routing metadata). ResultEnvelopeExtensions bridge Result&lt;T&gt; ↔ Envelope&lt;T&gt; at service boundaries. Zero external NuGet dependencies. AOT-safe STJ source-generated serialization.</Description>
    <PackageTags>contracts;dtos;integration-events;paged-list;cursor-pagination;envelope;shared-kernel;result-envelope-mapping</PackageTags>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <!--
      SharedKernel.Primitives: supplies Error, ErrorType, Result<T> primitives consumed by Envelope types.
      SharedKernel.Domain: supplies IDomainEvent (constraint on EventEnvelope<TEvent>) and
                           DomainEventVersionHelper.GetVersion(Type) (populating EventVersion in Wrap).
      No other project or NuGet references are permitted in this package.
    -->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\01.Core\SharedKernel.Primitives\SharedKernel.Primitives.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\03.Domain\SharedKernel.Domain\SharedKernel.Domain.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
